## Frozen Sol Comparison Sources

- [Sol L'Homme frozen source](baselines/source/L_Homme_Luxe_30mL_EdP.md)
- [Sol La Nuit frozen source](baselines/source/La_Nuit_de_LHomme_Luxe_30mL_EDT.md)

The source snapshots are byte-identical to the manifest-bound authoritative files. Disposable 298.15 K runs are under `output/ysl_twenty_variant_study/baselines/`; the report documents the current CLI's legacy `unspecified` stock-basis incompatibility and the narrowly scoped in-memory diagnostic shim.

## Tracked Versus Generated Evidence

Tracked canonical artifacts are under this study directory. Generated full JSON, formatter text, hot-temperature sensitivity output, and disposable baseline runs are under `output/ysl_twenty_variant_study/` and are gitignored. The generated outputs are evidence only when their hashes match the tracked summary or report bindings.

## Claim Ceiling

These are research formulas, not authenticated YSL recipes. ODT/OAV, composite-natural models, note distributions, and time windows are diagnostics. Ingredient count is not treated as complexity. Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, measured headspace, and release are **NOT TESTED**; safety is **NOT CLEARED**.
